{"displayStem":"독립 제작 림프절 단면 모식도에서 X와 Y를 표적화했다. 조직 구획만 나타내며 세포별 염색 강도를 재현한 영상은 아니다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육용 가상 자료"}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C05 c05-batch\"><div class=\"evidence c05-figure\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 620 360\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"독립 제작 구조 모식도\"><rect width=\"620\" height=\"360\" fill=\"white\"></rect><g font-family=\"Noto Sans CJK KR, sans-serif\" fill=\"black\"><path d=\"M90 180Q90 45 310 50Q540 60 525 230Q480 335 310 315Q105 320 90 180Z\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path><text x=\"30\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"22\">피막</text><path d=\"M80 45L135 80\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"115\" rx=\"38\" ry=\"32\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></ellipse><ellipse cx=\"285\" cy=\"100\" rx=\"38\" ry=\"32\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></ellipse><ellipse cx=\"400\" cy=\"120\" rx=\"38\" ry=\"32\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></ellipse><text x=\"170\" y=\"120\" font-size=\"22\">X</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"208\" font-size=\"22\">Y</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"285\" font-size=\"20\">속질</text><path d=\"M310 5L310 50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><path d=\"M310 50L305.6503446588877 40.99552897647323\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><path d=\"M310 50L314.3496553411123 40.99552897647323\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><text x=\"355\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"18\">들림프관</text><path d=\"M525 245L590 260\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><path d=\"M590 260L580.2480613584761 262.2135249562524\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><path d=\"M590 260L582.2041840671003 253.7369932188806\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><text x=\"490\" y=\"310\" font-size=\"18\">날림프관</text></g></svg></div></di